INSERT INTO `areas` VALUES (1,'Vasant Vihar','Vasant Vihar: The Grand Diplomatic Boulevards of South Delhi','Planned across wide tree-canopied avenues hosting over 50 foreign missions, independent luxury bungalows, and bespoke builder floors.','Territory Monograph 01 · South Delhi','[{\"label\": \"Prevailing Rate\", \"value\": \"\\u20b91,20,000\\u20131,50,000\"}, {\"label\": \"Plot Footprint\", \"value\": \"400\\u20131,000+ Sq. Yds\"}, {\"label\": \"Title Status\", \"value\": \"100% Freehold\"}, {\"label\": \"Security Profile\", \"value\": \"Diplomatic A1 Security\"}]','vasant-vihar','Delhi\'s signature diplomatic residential enclave, renowned for expansive freehold plots, high-level security, and premier ambassadorial residences.','This is not just a colony, it\'s a status. Vasant Vihar is a diplomatic and residential sub-division of New Delhi, located next to Chanakyapuri and houses over 50 diplomatic missions including embassies of Argentina, South Africa, Japan, Germany. That means - highest security in Delhi, cleanest roads, no commercial chaos, only bungalows and low-rise builder floors.\n\nFor a buyer, it means your neighbours are Ambassadors, CEOs, and old business families.\n\nFamous for its premium independent residential properties. The colony is planned on 4 main roads - Vasant Marg, Munirka Marg, Poorvi Marg and Paschimi Marg. Very green, wide roads, no traffic inside.','[\"100% Freehold Ownership\", \"Strict Low-Density Residential Zoning\", \"High Owner-Occupancy Ratio\", \"Proven Generational Capital Appreciation\"]','This is not just a colony, it\'s a status. Vasant Vihar is a diplomatic and residential sub-division of New Delhi, located next to Chanakyapuri and houses over 50 diplomatic missions including embassies of Argentina, South Africa, Japan, Germany. That means - highest security in Delhi, cleanest roads, no commercial chaos, only bungalows and low-rise builder floors.\n\nFor a buyer, it means your neighbours are Ambassadors, CEOs, and old business families.\n\nFamous for its premium independent residential properties. The colony is planned on 4 main roads - Vasant Marg, Munirka Marg, Poorvi Marg and Paschimi Marg. Very green, wide roads, no traffic inside.','The Vasant Vihar residential market represents one of Delhi\'s premier capital preservation destinations, defined by 100% freehold titles and persistent HNI demand.\n\nCurrent Market Benchmarks (2026):\n400 sqyd builder floor / plot: ₹28.5 Cr to ₹65 Cr and plot around ₹65 crore for 600 sq yards\n\n800 sqyd plot: Around ₹90 Cr\n\nPer sqft rate in Vasant Vihar is ₹1,20,000 to ₹1,50,000 per sqft\n\nYou can tell buyer: \"Sir, Vasant Vihar is ₹75-90 Cr for a decent bungalow plot, and after construction it goes to ₹150 Cr+\"\n\nPrevailing Land Rates: Approximately ₹1,20,000–1,50,000 / sq.ft. depending on avenue road width, plot frontage, orientation, and perimeter security.','Residential acquisitions in Vasant Vihar command meticulous legal and municipal due diligence. Title status (100% Freehold), permissible Basement+Stilt+3 floor FAR allowances, road setback regulations, and encumbrance-free verification are rigorously authenticated by Elite Homez prior to private client presentation.','[{\"title\": \"Luxury Builder Floors\", \"description\": \"Bespoke single-floor residences offering full-floor exclusivity, direct private elevator access, multi-car basement parking, and separate staff suites. A favored mandate format for corporate leaders and high-net-worth professionals.\", \"buyer_profile\": \"C-Suite Executives, Expats, Diplomats & Discerning HNIs\", \"cta_text\": \"Inquire About Floors\", \"cta_link\": \"/contact-us?subject=vasant-vihar+Luxury+Builder+Floor+Advisory\"}, {\"title\": \"Independent Luxury Bungalows\", \"description\": \"Generational detached estates featuring expansive private grounds, grand arched porticos, manicured formal lawns, swimming pavilions, and extensive perimeter security. Ultra-rare assets of enduring family legacy.\", \"buyer_profile\": \"Prominent Industrialists, Multi-Generational Families & Family Offices\", \"cta_text\": \"Explore Bungalow Estates\", \"cta_link\": \"/contact-us?subject=vasant-vihar+Bungalow+Estate+Advisory\"}, {\"title\": \"Prime Redevelopment Plots\", \"description\": \"Freehold residential land parcels permitting contemporary Basement + Stilt + 3 Floor construction. Uncompromised potential for bespoke architectural realization or long-term multi-generational wealth preservation.\", \"buyer_profile\": \"Visionary Builders, Legacy Investors & Private Wealth Principals\", \"cta_text\": \"View Available Plots\", \"cta_link\": \"/contact-us?subject=vasant-vihar+Redevelopment+Plot+Mandate\"}]','Residential Asset Categories','Typical Property Formats in Vasant Vihar','[{\"type\": \"Standard Enclave Plot\", \"size\": \"400 Sq. Yards (~3,600 Sq. Ft.)\", \"description\": \"Standard detached footprint for bespoke builder floors and private residences valued at \\u20b928.5 Cr \\u2013 \\u20b965 Cr.\"}, {\"type\": \"Mid-Size Estate Plot\", \"size\": \"600 Sq. Yards (~5,400 Sq. Ft.)\", \"description\": \"Most sought-after luxury mandate size commanding around \\u20b965 Cr for land, ideal for multi-level family estates.\"}, {\"type\": \"Sprawling Embassy Plot\", \"size\": \"800\\u20131,000+ Sq. Yards (~7,200\\u20139,000+ Sq. Ft.)\", \"description\": \"Generational corner and park-facing plots commanding \\u20b990 Cr to \\u20b9150 Cr+ post-construction.\"}]','Spatial Typologies','Typical Residential Plot Sizes in Vasant Vihar','Plot footprints in Vasant Vihar dictate permissible floor area ratio (FAR), setback requirements, and basement depth. Available property sizes vary considerably across individual listings.','Life in Vasant Vihar blends serene residential privacy with Delhi\'s most refined social and cultural ecosystems.\n\nConnectivity:\n\n10 mins to Chanakyapuri, 15 mins to Airport (via NH48)\n\nClose to Dhaula Kuan, IGI Airport\n\nNearby Attractions & Luxury:\n\nThe Chanakya Mall - Hermes, Chanel, Rolex - Delhi\'s most luxurious mall\n\nOne Golden Mile, Bhikaji Cama Place - high-end restaurants\n\nClubs: Delhi Gymkhana, Malcha Marg Club\n\nSchools for HNI families:\n\nThe British School, American Embassy School, Modern School Vasant Vihar - all within 5km\n\nSecurity:\n\nBecause of 50+ embassies, Delhi Police + Embassy security 24x7.','Neighborhood Ambiance','Lifestyle & Community in Vasant Vihar','The Vasant Vihar residential market represents one of Delhi\'s premier capital preservation destinations, defined by 100% freehold titles and persistent HNI demand.\n\nCurrent Market Benchmarks (2026):\n400 sqyd builder floor / plot: ₹28.5 Cr to ₹65 Cr and plot around ₹65 crore for 600 sq yards\n\n800 sqyd plot: Around ₹90 Cr\n\nPer sqft rate in Vasant Vihar is ₹1,20,000 to ₹1,50,000 per sqft\n\nYou can tell buyer: \"Sir, Vasant Vihar is ₹75-90 Cr for a decent bungalow plot, and after construction it goes to ₹150 Cr+\"\n\nPrevailing Land Rates: Approximately ₹1,20,000–1,50,000 / sq.ft. depending on avenue road width, plot frontage, orientation, and perimeter security.','Arterial Transit & Strategic Corridors:\nStrategically positioned with seamless arterial connectivity to the IGI Airport, Central Delhi power corridors, and South Delhi business districts.\n\nPositioned with immediate access to major peripheral ring roads and diplomatic transit corridors, ensuring effortless connectivity for senior executives, ambassadors, and family offices.','Arterial Infrastructure','Connectivity & Transit Links','Basant Lok, PVR Priya, Vasant Vihar Club, Southern Ridge Forest Reserve, Diplomatic Missions','[{\"name\":\"The British School New Delhi\",\"type\":\"International / IB & IGCSE\",\"location\":\"Chanakyapuri (~10 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Favored by diplomatic and expatriate families.\"},{\"name\":\"The American Embassy School (AES)\",\"type\":\"American Curriculum\",\"location\":\"Chanakyapuri (~12 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Gold-standard international academy with world-class athletic facilities.\"},{\"name\":\"Modern School Vasant Vihar\",\"type\":\"CBSE Elite Co-Ed\",\"location\":\"Poorvi Marg, Vasant Vihar\",\"highlight\":\"One of the capital\'s most prestigious primary academies located within the enclave.\"},{\"name\":\"The Mother\'s International School\",\"type\":\"CBSE / Sri Aurobindo Ashram\",\"location\":\"Sri Aurobindo Marg (~15 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Renowned for academic rigor and holistic development.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Fortis Flt. Lt. Rajan Dhall Hospital\",\"type\":\"Multi-Specialty Tertiary Care\",\"location\":\"Vasant Kunj (~8 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"JCI accredited comprehensive surgical and cardiac care.\"},{\"name\":\"Max Super Speciality Hospital Saket\",\"type\":\"Quaternary Healthcare Hub\",\"location\":\"Press Enclave Road (~15 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"State-of-the-art oncology, neurosciences, and emergency facilities.\"},{\"name\":\"Sitaram Bhartia Institute of Science and Research\",\"type\":\"Multi-Specialty Hospital\",\"location\":\"Qutab Institutional Area (~10 mins)\",\"highlight\":\"Known for evidence-based maternity and general medicine.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Basant Lok (PVR Priya Complex)\",\"type\":\"High-Street Retail & Cafes\",\"highlight\":\"Designer retail, gourmet markets, artisanal bakeries, and casual dining within walking distance.\"},{\"name\":\"DLF Promenade & Emporio\",\"type\":\"Ultra-Luxury Couture & Malls\",\"highlight\":\"Global fashion houses (Louis Vuitton, Gucci, Dior) located 7 minutes away in Vasant Kunj.\"},{\"name\":\"Malcha Marg Market\",\"type\":\"Diplomatic Dining Precinct\",\"highlight\":\"Exclusive legacy restaurants and delicatessens 10 minutes away in Chanakyapuri.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Vasant Vihar Club\",\"type\":\"Private Members Club\",\"highlight\":\"Exclusive sports, dining, and wellness club restricted to enclave residents.\"},{\"name\":\"Delhi Golf Club\",\"type\":\"Historic Championship Course\",\"highlight\":\"Historic 27-hole golf sanctuary 20 minutes away via Lutyens\' corridors.\"},{\"name\":\"The Southern Ridge Forest Trails\",\"type\":\"Natural Biodiversity Park\",\"highlight\":\"Extensive forested walking tracks offering pristine air quality and bird watching.\"}]','When evaluating residential acquisitions in Vasant Vihar, buyers should verify land title clarity, succession documentation, and municipal property tax records. Due to strict building bylaws enforced by the Municipal Corporation of Delhi (MCD), ensure that builder floors have sanctioned building plans covering the specific floor level, independent electrical and water meter connections, and registered demarcation agreements for stilt car parking bays. If considering an older bungalow for redevelopment, evaluate the permissible Floor Area Ratio (FAR), ground coverage limits, tree-cutting permissions from the Forest Department, and structural setback requirements. Elite Homez provides comprehensive legal due diligence, title search certificates from senior advocates, and forensic valuation assessments prior to any contract execution.','Vasant Vihar commands robust rental yields and persistent leasing interest from foreign diplomatic missions, international non-governmental organizations, and Fortune 500 multinational leadership. Preferred rental assets are modern 4-bedroom apartments with high-security access, independent service entrances, 100% DG power backup, and dedicated parking. Diplomatic leases typically involve multi-year terms with standard diplomatic termination clauses, MEA clearance protocols, and corporate institutional guarantees.','Elite Homez maintains direct relationships with multi-generational resident owners and premier developers in Vasant Vihar. We operate off-market to present verified residential assets with complete discretion.','Elite Homez Private Office','Local Knowledge. Better Property Decisions.','Whether acquiring an off-market generational bungalow or an ultra-luxury builder floor, our senior partner desk provides forensic title verification, zoning audits, and bilateral discretion across Vasant Vihar.','Initiate Private Mandate','/contact-us?subject=vasant-vihar+Confidential+Advisory','Call Advisory Desk','tel:+911149008800','[{\"question\": \"What is the typical property structure and construction permissible in Vasant Vihar?\", \"answer\": \"Properties in Vasant Vihar are planned on freehold residential plots ranging from 400\\u20131,000+ Sq. Yds. Under Delhi building bye-laws, owners can construct a Basement + Stilt parking + 3 residential upper floors, subject to specific municipal setback and floor area ratio (FAR) guidelines.\"}, {\"question\": \"Are properties in Vasant Vihar freehold or leasehold?\", \"answer\": \"All prime residential properties in Vasant Vihar are 100% Freehold, which is a major attraction for long-term wealth preservation, foreign diplomatic missions, and NRI investors. Conveyance deeds are registered directly with the competent revenue authority.\"}, {\"question\": \"What are the prevailing land rates and price brackets in Vasant Vihar for 2026?\", \"answer\": \"As of 2026, land rates in Vasant Vihar range approximately from \\u20b91,20,000\\u20131,50,000 / sq.ft. of plot area, depending on road width, corner frontage, and proximity to green parks. Luxury builder floors typically range from entry floor plates upwards of \\u20b915\\u201340 Cr+, while independent bungalow properties command \\u20b950\\u2013200 Cr+.\"}, {\"question\": \"How secure is Vasant Vihar compared to other South Delhi colonies?\", \"answer\": \"Vasant Vihar benefits from Diplomatic A1 Security along with regular Delhi Police patrols, dedicated Resident Welfare Association (RWA) security gates, and close proximity to diplomatic and government administrative zones, making it one of the capital\'s safest neighborhoods.\"}, {\"question\": \"What are the leasing demand and rental yields in Vasant Vihar?\", \"answer\": \"Vasant Vihar experiences persistent leasing demand from multinational chief executives, diplomats, expatriate counsel, and senior jurists. Well-appointed luxury builder floors and standalone bungalows achieve premium yields under long-term corporate leases.\"}]','Local Advisory Insights','Frequently Asked Questions: Vasant Vihar','/assets/images/areas/vasant-vihar.jpg','Luxury residential boulevard and private estates in Vasant Vihar, South Delhi','Fiduciary Client Representation','Begin Your Residential Search in Vasant Vihar','Whether seeking an off-market independent bungalow or a bespoke modern builder floor, Elite Homez provides verified confidential guidance in Vasant Vihar.','Share Your Requirement','/contact-us?subject=Direct+Inquiry%3A+vasant-vihar','WhatsApp Advisory','https://wa.me/919811000000?text=Hello%2C+I+would+like+to+inquire+about+luxury+properties+in+Vasant Vihar.','[{\"image\":\"/assets/images/properties/villa-vasant-vihar.jpg\",\"caption\":\"Private modern villa courtyard in Vasant Vihar\"},{\"image\":\"/assets/images/stitch/area-vasant-vihar-twilight.jpg\",\"caption\":\"Twilight exterior of an architectural bungalow on Poorvi Marg\"},{\"image\":\"/assets/images/stitch/vasant-vihar-penthouse.jpg\",\"caption\":\"Bespoke penthouse terrace overlooking the Southern Ridge canopy\"}]','https://maps.google.com/?q=Vasant+Vihar+New+Delhi',1,1,1,'Luxury Property in Vasant Vihar, South Delhi | Elite Homez Advisory','luxury property in Vasant Vihar','Vasant Vihar real estate, builder floors in Vasant Vihar, bungalows for sale Vasant Vihar, luxury homes South Delhi','Vasant Vihar Luxury Real Estate Advisory | Elite Homez','Discover verified luxury residences, penthouses, and independent bungalows in Vasant Vihar, New Delhi.','Explore luxury bungalows, independent builder floors, and prime residential estates for sale and lease in Vasant Vihar, South Delhi.','2026-09-12 12:09:52','2026-11-16 17:41:40'),(2,'Jor Bagh','Jor Bagh: Delhi’s Most Exclusive Heritage Residential Address','Facing the centuries-old canopy of Lodhi Gardens, this elite central enclave embodies old-money prestige, discretion, and freehold legacy.','Territory Monograph 02 · South Delhi','[{\"label\": \"Prevailing Rate\", \"value\": \"\\u20b91,50,000\\u20132,50,000+\"}, {\"label\": \"Plot Footprint\", \"value\": \"300\\u2013800+ Sq. Yds\"}, {\"label\": \"Title Status\", \"value\": \"100% Freehold\"}, {\"label\": \"Security Profile\", \"value\": \"Central Legacy Security\"}]','jor-bagh','An aristocratic enclave adjoining Lodhi Gardens and Khan Market, revered for generational heritage bungalows and unparalleled central tranquility.','Jor Bagh is one of the most prestigious and tightly held residential colonies in New Delhi. Located between Lutyens’ Delhi, Lodhi Estate, and Safdarjung Tomb, it is considered one of the most elite residential addresses in India.\n\nUnlike many luxury locations, Jor Bagh offers a rare combination of heritage charm, central location, and ultra-low density living. Properties here are owned by industrialists, diplomats, senior bureaucrats, business families, and old Delhi elite.\n\nFor a buyer, it means living in a neighborhood where privacy, exclusivity, and legacy matter more than flashy luxury.\n\nJor Bagh is strategically located in the heart of New Delhi, surrounded by some of the capital’s most important landmarks.\n\nThe colony is known for:\n\nWide tree-lined avenues\n\nLow-rise residential environment\n\nIndependent bungalows and premium builder floors\n\nWalking distance to Lodhi Garden\n\nExtremely limited property supply\n\nThe area maintains a calm and green atmosphere despite being in the center of Delhi.','[\"100% Freehold Ownership\", \"Strict Low-Density Residential Zoning\", \"High Owner-Occupancy Ratio\", \"Proven Generational Capital Appreciation\"]','Jor Bagh is one of the most prestigious and tightly held residential colonies in New Delhi. Located between Lutyens’ Delhi, Lodhi Estate, and Safdarjung Tomb, it is considered one of the most elite residential addresses in India.\n\nUnlike many luxury locations, Jor Bagh offers a rare combination of heritage charm, central location, and ultra-low density living. Properties here are owned by industrialists, diplomats, senior bureaucrats, business families, and old Delhi elite.\n\nFor a buyer, it means living in a neighborhood where privacy, exclusivity, and legacy matter more than flashy luxury.\n\nJor Bagh is strategically located in the heart of New Delhi, surrounded by some of the capital’s most important landmarks.\n\nThe colony is known for:\n\nWide tree-lined avenues\n\nLow-rise residential environment\n\nIndependent bungalows and premium builder floors\n\nWalking distance to Lodhi Garden\n\nExtremely limited property supply\n\nThe area maintains a calm and green atmosphere despite being in the center of Delhi.','The Jor Bagh residential market represents one of Delhi\'s premier capital preservation destinations, defined by 100% freehold titles and persistent HNI demand.\n\nCurrent Market Benchmarks (2026):\nLuxury builder floors (300–500 sq. yards): ₹20 Cr – ₹50 Cr+\n\n500 sq. yard plot: ₹55 Cr – ₹75 Cr\n\n800 sq. yard plot: ₹90 Cr – ₹130 Cr+\n\nPremium bungalow properties: ₹150 Cr – ₹300 Cr+\n\nApproximate Land Rate:\n\n₹1,50,000 – ₹2,50,000+ per sq. ft. of plot area depending on location and frontage.\n\nYou can tell a buyer:\n\n\"Sir, Jor Bagh is among the rarest residential markets in India. A good plot starts around ₹60–70 Cr, while trophy bungalow assets can easily cross ₹200 Cr.\"\n\nPrevailing Land Rates: Approximately ₹1,50,000–2,50,000+ / sq.ft. depending on avenue road width, plot frontage, orientation, and perimeter security.','Residential acquisitions in Jor Bagh command meticulous legal and municipal due diligence. Title status (100% Freehold), permissible Basement+Stilt+3 floor FAR allowances, road setback regulations, and encumbrance-free verification are rigorously authenticated by Elite Homez prior to private client presentation.','[{\"