 ₹35 Cr\n\n500 sq. yard plots: ₹30 Cr – ₹50 Cr+\n\n800 sq. yard plots: ₹50 Cr – ₹80 Cr+\n\nPremium bungalow properties: ₹80 Cr – ₹150 Cr+\n\nApproximate Land Rate:\n\n₹70,000 – ₹1,20,000+ per sq. ft. depending on road width, location, and frontage.\n\nYou can tell a buyer:\n\n\"Sir, Anand Niketan offers premium freehold plots in one of Delhi\'s most secure and well-connected neighborhoods. A quality 500 sq. yard plot typically ranges between ₹30–50 Cr, while luxury bungalow properties can exceed ₹100 Cr.\"\n\nPrevailing Land Rates: Approximately ₹80,000–1,30,000+ / sq.ft. depending on avenue road width, plot frontage, orientation, and perimeter security.','Residential acquisitions in Anand Niketan command meticulous legal and municipal due diligence. Title status (100% Freehold), permissible Basement+Stilt+3 floor FAR allowances, road setback regulations, and encumbrance-free verification are rigorously authenticated by Elite Homez prior to private client presentation.','[{\"title\": \"Luxury Builder Floors\", \"description\": \"Bespoke single-floor residences offering full-floor exclusivity, direct private elevator access, multi-car basement parking, and separate staff suites. A favored mandate format for corporate leaders and high-net-worth professionals.\", \"buyer_profile\": \"C-Suite Executives, Expats, Diplomats & Discerning HNIs\", \"cta_text\": \"Inquire About Floors\", \"cta_link\": \"/contact-us?subject=anand-niketan+Luxury+Builder+Floor+Advisory\"}, {\"title\": \"Independent Luxury Bungalows\", \"description\": \"Generational detached estates featuring expansive private grounds, grand arched porticos, manicured formal lawns, swimming pavilions, and extensive perimeter security. Ultra-rare assets of enduring family legacy.\", \"buyer_profile\": \"Prominent Industrialists, Multi-Generational Families & Family Offices\", \"cta_text\": \"Explore Bungalow Estates\", \"cta_link\": \"/contact-us?subject=anand-niketan+Bungalow+Estate+Advisory\"}, {\"title\": \"Pr