INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (1,'Luxury Property Buying Advisory','luxury-property-buying-advisory','Independent, discreet buy-side representation for ultra-high-net-worth individuals, family offices, and discerning investors seeking prime residential estates across South Delhi’s most coveted enclaves.','## Turnkey Private Client Acquisition\r\n\r\nAcquiring prime residential property in Delhi NCR demands more than market access—it requires deep institutional diligence, discretion, and uncompromised advocacy. Elite Homez operates exclusively on a buy-side mandate, ensuring our clients receive unconflicted guidance, off-market access, and comprehensive statutory protection from initial discovery through to deed execution.','/assets/images/services/uhnw-advisory.jpg','compass',1,1,1,'Luxury Property Buying Advisory | Elite Homez Private Office Delhi','Independent buy-side luxury real estate advisory for HNIs, family offices, and NRIs in Vasant Vihar, Jor Bagh, Golf Links, and Chanakyapuri.','2026-09-12 12:09:52','2026-11-16 15:02:59','Practice Mandate 01 · Private Client Buy-Side Advisory','ELITE HOMEZ · PRIVATE REAL ESTATE ADVISORY','Exclusive Buy-Side Mandate','Zero Conflict · 100% Buyer Aligned','The Elite Homez Buy-Side Approach','Property decisions deserve a more personal, discreet approach.','In the rarefied landscape of South Delhi’s trophy residential enclaves—from Vasant Vihar and Jor Bagh to Shanti Niketan and Golf Links—true value is rarely discovered on public real estate portals. Elite Homez serves as your private fiduciary advisor, delivering confidential off-market intelligence, bespoke property profiling, and forensic legal vetting.','[{\"label\": \"Buyer Fiduciary Alignment\", \"value\": \"100%\"}, {\"label\": \"Title & Encumbrance Audits\", \"value\": \"30+ Yrs\"}, {\"label\": \"Advised Transaction Value\", \"value\": \"₹1,200Cr+\"}]','Systematic Due Diligence','What We Do for Prime Buyers','A rigorous five-stage methodology engineered specifically for high-value residential acquisitions.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"tag\": \"Confidential Discovery\", \"desc\": \"We conduct structured briefing sessions to codify family lifestyle rhythms, architectural preferences, security clearances, and capital deployment timelines.\", \"title\": \"Bespoke Spatial Profiling\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"tag\": \"Exclusive Access\", \"desc\": \"Direct access to unlisted estates, private family trusts, and generational holdings across Delhi’s premier diplomatic and residential avenues.\", \"title\": \"Private Off-Market Scouting\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"tag\": \"30-Year Audit\", \"desc\": \"Rigorous examination of mother title deeds, municipal sanctions, FAR compliance, structural integrity, and environmental clearances.\", \"title\": \"Forensic Due Diligence\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"tag\": \"Pricing Defense\", \"desc\": \"Institutional valuation benchmarking based on registered enclave transaction indices rather than speculative seller asking prices.\", \"title\": \"Strategic Negotiation\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"tag\": \"Deed Execution\", \"desc\": \"End-to-end stewardship of sale deed drafting, RERA compliance, stamp duty execution, and seamless post-possession onboarding.\", \"title\": \"Conveyance & Concierge Handover\"}]','Acquisition Roadmap','From Requirement to Handover','A six-stage structured journey engineered for absolute peace of mind and decisive execution.','[{\"desc\": \"Codifying lifestyle criteria, enclave boundaries, and capital allocation timelines.\", \"step\": \"01\", \"title\": \"Mandate Definition\"}, {\"desc\": \"Curating discreet private listings vetted against strict institutional quality filters.\", \"step\": \"02\", \"title\": \"Off-Market Curation\"}, {\"desc\": \"Arranging confidential, escorted walkthroughs tailored entirely to your schedule.\", \"step\": \"03\", \"title\": \"Private Viewings\"}, {\"desc\": \"30-year forensic registry verification, zoning validation, and structural inspection.\", \"step\": \"04\", \"title\": \"Title & Technical Audit\"}, {\"desc\": \"Discreet buy-side price negotiations securing optimal terms and contract protections.\", \"step\": \"05\", \"title\": \"Fiduciary Negotiation\"}, {\"desc\": \"Registration under statutory oversight, registry formalization, and keys transfer.\", \"step\": \"06\", \"title\": \"Execution & Handover\"}]','“Access matters. Judgement matters more.”','Our role is not simply to show you property. It is to help you make an enduring, generational decision anchored in verifiable value and peace of mind.','/assets/images/services/residential-advisory.jpg','Why Elite Homez for Acquisitions','Institutional experience, total discretion, and granular mastery of premier South Delhi real estate.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"desc\": \"Decades cultivating direct relationships with prominent landholders, architects, and estate trustees across Vasant Vihar, Jor Bagh, and Golf Links.\", \"icon\": \"history_edu\", \"title\": \"20+ Years in Prime Enclaves\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"desc\": \"The majority of our transactions never appear in print or online portals; transacted in total privacy through private family trusts.\", \"icon\": \"visibility_off\", \"title\": \"100% Off-Market Access\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"desc\": \"Unmatched intelligence on plot geometry, road widths, FAR norms, municipal water infrastructure, and quiet residential lanes.\", \"icon\": \"location_on\", \"title\": \"Granular Enclave Mastery\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"desc\": \"Every mandate is directly stewarded by senior leadership, never delegated to junior sales representatives.\", \"icon\": \"person\", \"title\": \"Principal-Led Engagement\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"desc\": \"All negotiations, client identities, and transaction structures remain strictly confidential under legally binding NDA protocols.\", \"icon\": \"lock\", \"title\": \"Bilateral NDA Confidentiality\"}, {\"num\": \"06\", \"desc\": \"Fully registered under DLRERA2023A00892, backed by top property legal counsel to assure zero legacy encumbrances.\", \"icon\": \"verified_user\", \"title\": \"DLRERA Compliant Governance\"}]','/assets/images/properties/villa-vasant-vihar.jpg','Private Residence · Vasant Vihar','Curated Acquisition','Beyond Brokering','More than a property transaction. An enduring generational asset.','Traditional brokerages are incentivized by volume and quick closures. As a fiduciary advisory practice, we advise clients against purchasing properties that fail our rigorous 42-point due diligence checklist. We protect your capital as if it were our own.','[\"Independent Valuations\", \"Discreet Viewings\", \"Legal Conveyance Oversight\", \"Post-Purchase Onboarding\"]','Tailored Client Desks','Who We Help','Our acquisition advisory is crafted specifically for discerning purchasers with distinct governance criteria.','[{\"desc\": \"Families seeking an enduring primary residence, generational builder floor, or standalone bungalow in Delhi’s finest enclaves.\", \"icon\": \"home\", \"title\": \"Private Home Buyers\"}, {\"desc\": \"Capital stewards acquiring defensive real assets with superior capital preservation and long-term liquidity profiles.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Family Offices\"}, {\"desc\": \"Non-resident leaders requiring trusted on-ground proxy representation with complete legal clarity and zero conflicts.\", \"icon\": \"public\", \"title\": \"Global Indians & NRIs\"}, {\"desc\": \"Established homeowners moving to superior architectural scale, modern acoustic shielding, and multi-vehicle parking.\", \"icon\": \"trending_up\", \"title\": \"Upgrading Delhi Residents\"}]','Speak with an Advisor','#confidential-desk','[\"South Delhi Enclaves\", \"Zero Conflict of Interest\", \"RERA Certified\"]','Perspective · Discernment · Heritage','Request A Private Briefing','#confidential-desk','Fiduciary Excellence','Bespoke Guidance & Clarity','Frequently Asked Questions','Clear answers to the most common questions regarding our private advisory services and confidential engagement process.','[{\"answer\": \"We operate under an exclusive buy-side fiduciary agreement. Following a confidential discovery briefing to codify spatial, architectural, and financial parameters, we conduct structured market sweeps across private family office portfolios and off-market networks, presenting vetted properties with forensic title, zoning, and structural due diligence before private viewings.\", \"question\": \"How does the private client acquisition mandate work?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Over 70% of trophy transactions in premier South Delhi enclaves (such as Vasant Vihar, Jor Bagh, and Golf Links) are conducted off-market to preserve discretion. Our mandates provide direct access to verified private trusts, non-public developer inventory, and private resident listings.\", \"question\": \"Are all property options shared kept strictly off-market?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Every recommended property undergoes forensic 30-year title tracing, encumbrance audits, mutation deed reviews, and masterplan zoning checks led by independent senior property advocates before client offers are structured.\", \"question\": \"How does Elite Homez verify legal title and municipal sanctions?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Our fee structure is completely transparent, success-contingent, and governed by bilateral advisory agreements without hidden markups, referral kickbacks, or split-broker conflicts.\", \"question\": \"What are your advisory fees and commercial terms?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. We frequently act as authorized on-ground acquisition proxies for NRIs, global family offices, and foreign embassy chancery mandates, handling FEMA compliance, virtual walkthroughs, and legal conveyance.\", \"question\": \"Can you assist international NRIs and foreign missions?\"}]','Confidential Dialogue','Initiate a Private Advisory Briefing','Share your parameters. A designated Elite Homez Senior Partner will contact you under strict bilateral confidentiality.','[\"Direct Senior Partner Representation\", \"Strict Bilateral Non-Disclosure\", \"Zero Commercial Bias\"]','Submit Confidential Mandate','Elite Homez Advisory','The right property starts with the right advice.','Discover a more considered, confidential way to navigate premier Delhi NCR real estate.','/assets/images/stitch/service-cta-dusk.jpg','Explore Properties Catalogue','/properties','Contact Advisory Desk','/contact-us'),(2,'Luxury Property Selling Mandate','luxury-property-selling-mandate','Confidential representation and strategic off-market divestment for trophy residences, historic bungalows, and prime redevelopment plots across Delhi’s premier addresses.','## Exclusive Off-Market Seller Representation\n\nDivesting a high-value residential asset in South Delhi requires an approach radically different from conventional open-market brokerage. Public listings, open portals, and broad-scale marketing devalue exclusive estates and compromise family privacy. Elite Homez executes exclusive private selling mandates through curated, vetted matchmaking—connecting your property only with qualified principals under non-disclosure protocols.','/assets/images/services/asset-divestment.jpg','award',1,1,2,'Luxury Property Selling Mandate | Off-Market Real Estate Delhi','Exclusive, confidential selling mandates for trophy properties and prime bungalows in South Delhi. Off-market placement by Elite Homez.','2026-09-12 12:09:52','2026-11-16 15:02:59','Practice Mandate 02 · Exclusive Private Placement Mandate','ELITE HOMEZ · DISCREET ASSET MONETIZATION','Off-Market Seller Representation','Strict NDA Protection · Qualified Buyers Only','The Private Divestment Mandate','Preserving asset prestige through controlled, off-market placement.','When selling a generational property in enclaves like Golf Links, Shanti Niketan, or Anand Niketan, overexposure is the greatest risk to asset value. We maintain absolute confidentiality, curating a targeted buyer pool of pre-qualified family offices, corporate leaders, and high-net-worth buyers without mass-market broadcasting.','[{\"label\": \"Off-Market Discretion\", \"value\": \"100%\"}, {\"label\": \"Higher Avg. Price Realization\", \"value\": \"4.8%\"}, {\"label\": \"Avg. Vetted Buyer Matchmaking\", \"value\": \"14 Days\"}]','Comprehensive Seller Advisory','What We Deliver for Property Owners','A bespoke monetization protocol designed to maximize asset value without public exposure.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"tag\": \"Defensible Pricing\", \"desc\": \"In-depth micro-market valuation based on recent registered transactions, plot efficiency, FAR potential, and architectural premium.\", \"title\": \"Asset Valuation & Benchmarking\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"tag\": \"Curated Presentation\", \"desc\": \"Creation of an exclusive, anonymized Private Information Memorandum (PIM) showcasing technical specs and floorplans without disclosing owner identity.\", \"title\": \"Confidential Dossier Preparation\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"tag\": \"Vetted Buyers\", \"desc\": \"Direct engagement with our proprietary network of verified buyers, multi-family offices, and private wealth managers.\", \"title\": \"Pre-Screened Matchmaking\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"tag\": \"Discreet Access\", \"desc\": \"All property viewings are strictly pre-cleared, scheduled with advance notice, and personally escorted by a Senior Partner.\", \"title\": \"Private Escorted Showings\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"tag\": \"Legal Security\", \"desc\": \"Supervising contract negotiations, escrow coordination, payment milestones, and statutory capital gains tax advisory.\", \"title\": \"Transaction Structuring & Closing\"}]','Disinvestment Roadmap','From Mandate to Complete Settlement','A disciplined, five-stage protocol ensuring maximum financial realization and total privacy.','[{\"desc\": \"Formalizing exclusive terms, pricing boundaries, and legal non-disclosure covenants.\", \"step\": \"01\", \"title\": \"Private Mandate Agreement\"}, {\"desc\": \"Pre-emptive title checks and municipal clearance audits to eliminate deal friction.\", \"step\": \"02\", \"title\": \"Title & Compliance Review\"}, {\"desc\": \"Presenting the confidential dossier directly to pre-screened, financially verified buyers.\", \"step\": \"03\", \"title\": \"Curated Private Placement\"}, {\"desc\": \"Managing bidding dynamics and payment structuring to achieve maximum price realization.\", \"step\": \"04\", \"title\": \"High-Stakes Negotiation\"}, {\"desc\": \"Executing the registered conveyance deed and securing complete fund settlement.\", \"step\": \"05\", \"title\": \"Final Conveyance & Registry\"}]','“True exclusivity is never broadcast. It is discreetly placed.”','Protecting your family’s privacy while commanding the highest market valuation through targeted, institutional matchmaking.','/assets/images/properties/manor-panchsheel.jpg','Why Sellers Trust Elite Homez','Decades of trusted access to Delhi’s highest-tier private capital pools.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"desc\": \"Your property is never listed on public aggregator portals or exposed to speculative window-shoppers.\", \"icon\": \"lock\", \"title\": \"Absolute Anonymity Guaranteed\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"desc\": \"Proprietary relationships with prominent industrialists, ambassadors, and multi-family office advisors.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Direct Access to UHNW Buyers\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"desc\": \"Sophisticated bidding strategy and micro-market intelligence to eliminate arbitrary buyer discounting.\", \"icon\": \"trending_up\", \"title\": \"Maximum Price Realization\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"desc\": \"Expert guidance on FEMA, RBI regulations for NRI buyers, and statutory capital gains structuring.\", \"icon\": \"shield\", \"title\": \"Forensic Deal Structuring\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"desc\": \"Every interaction is overseen by a founding principal committed to your fiduciary goals.\", \"icon\": \"person\", \"title\": \"Single Point of Senior Accountability\"}, {\"num\": \"06\", \"desc\": \"Full statutory compliance protecting sellers against contractual ambiguities and post-sale claims.\", \"icon\": \"verified_user\", \"title\": \"RERA-Sanctioned Integrity\"}]','/assets/images/properties/residence-shanti-niketan.jpg','Architectural Residence · Shanti Niketan','Private Placement','The Exclusive Difference','Protecting your legacy while unlocking optimum capital value.','Selling an estate of significant heritage or architectural value requires diplomatic tact. We manage the delicate balance between confidential presentation and competitive interest, ensuring that only genuine principals gain access to your home.','[\"Off-Market Discretion\", \"Direct Principal Matchmaking\", \"Pre-emptive Legal Audits\", \"Secure Escrow & Settlement\"]','Seller Client Desks','Who We Advise','Serving discerning property owners seeking a sophisticated, confidential monetization strategy.','[{\"desc\": \"Families divesting ancestral plots, joint family estates, or standalone bungalows across prime South Delhi.\", \"icon\": \"home\", \"title\": \"Generational Bungalow Owners\"}, {\"desc\": \"Legal trustees and executors seeking professional, transparent asset monetization with clear audit trails.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Private Trusts & Estates\"}, {\"desc\": \"Executives relocating or reallocating capital who require total confidentiality from market speculation.\", \"icon\": \"business\", \"title\": \"Corporate Leaders & Founders\"}, {\"desc\": \"NRI owners requiring trusted, comprehensive local representation for smooth repatriation of sale proceeds.\", \"icon\": \"public\", \"title\": \"Global Non-Resident Owners\"}]','Speak with an Advisor','#confidential-desk','[\"South Delhi Enclaves\", \"Zero Conflict of Interest\", \"RERA Certified\"]','Perspective · Discernment · Heritage','Request A Private Briefing','#confidential-desk','Fiduciary Excellence','Bespoke Guidance & Clarity','Frequently Asked Questions','Clear answers to the most common questions regarding our private advisory services and confidential engagement process.','[{\"answer\": \"We never publish public listings, photographs, or addresses without explicit written consent. Prospective buyers are pre-screened for financial liquidity and identity verification, and all walkthroughs are conducted under strict non-disclosure covenants.\", \"question\": \"How do you safeguard owner privacy during property divestment?\"}, {\"answer\": \"We benchmark asset valuations against real closed transaction registries, circle rates, and micro-market plot indices rather than speculative portal asking prices, ensuring optimal capital extraction.\", \"question\": \"How is pricing determined for trophy assets in South Delhi?\"}, {\"answer\": \"A curated off-market mandate typically achieves binding terms within 45 to 90 days, depending on enclave inventory liquidity and buyer alignment.\", \"question\": \"What is the typical timeframe for an off-market disposition?\"}]','Confidential Dialogue','Initiate a Private Advisory Briefing','Share your parameters. A designated Elite Homez Senior Partner will contact you under strict bilateral confidentiality.','[\"Direct Senior Partner Representation\", \"Strict Bilateral Non-Disclosure\", \"Zero Commercial Bias\"]','Submit Confidential Mandate','Elite Homez Advisory','The right property starts with the right advice.','Discover a more considered, confidential way to navigate premier Delhi NCR real estate.','/assets/images/stitch/service-cta-dusk.jpg','Explore Properties Catalogue','/properties','Contact Advisory Desk','/contact-us'),(3,'Diplomatic & Executive Leasing','diplomatic-executive-leasing','Specialized tenancy representation for foreign missions, ambassadorial residences, Fortune 500 leadership, and supranational institutions in Delhi’s high-security corridors.','## Chancery Grade Housing & Diplomatic Relocation\n\nDiplomatic missions, international chanceries, and multinational executive leadership operate under exacting housing security directives, bilateral lease conventions, and consular protocols. Elite Homez provides specialized leasing advisory across Chanakyapuri, Vasant Vihar, and Shanti Niketan—curating residences that meet international setback standards, perimeter defenses, dual power redundancies, and ambassadorial reception requirements.','/assets/images/properties/floor-chanakyapuri.jpg','shield',1,1,3,'Diplomatic & Executive Leasing Delhi | Embassy Housing Advisory','Specialized diplomatic and expatriate leasing advisory in Chanakyapuri, Vasant Vihar, and Golf Links. Embassy-grade residences by Elite Homez.','2026-09-12 12:09:52','2026-11-16 15:02:59','Practice Mandate 03 · Embassy & Chancery Grade Leasing','ELITE HOMEZ · HIGH-SECURITY RESIDENCE MANDATES','Chancery & Consular Protocol','Diplomatic Grade Security · Turnkey Relocation','The Diplomatic Leasing Standard','Exacting security standards paired with refined residential luxury.','We bridge the unique requirements of foreign ministries and global corporate leaders with Delhi’s most prestigious property owners. Every residence in our diplomatic portfolio is vetted for setback compliance, vehicular access control, secondary egress points, and infrastructure stability.','[{\"label\": \"Foreign Missions Served\", \"value\": \"45+\"}, {\"label\": \"Diplomatic Protocol Compliant\", \"value\": \"100%\"}, {\"label\": \"Typical Institutional Lease Term\", \"value\": \"3-5 Yrs\"}]','Protocol & Tenancy Advisory','Services for Diplomatic Missions & Expats','End-to-end relocation, security vetting, and bilateral lease administration.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"tag\": \"Chancery Protocol\", \"desc\": \"Assessment of perimeter security, guard quarters, biometric access adaptability, and boundary setback mandates.\", \"title\": \"Security & Setback Audits\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"tag\": \"Bilateral Terms\", \"desc\": \"Standardization of internationally recognized diplomatic clauses, mutual break options, and currency indexations.\", \"title\": \"Diplomatic Lease Drafting\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"tag\": \"Infrastructure Ready\", \"desc\": \"Verification of 100% power backup generators, centralized water filtration, acoustic glass, and climate systems.\", \"title\": \"Turnkey MEP & HVAC Verification\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"tag\": \"Asset Registry\", \"desc\": \"Detailed photographic and digital inventory condition reports to protect both mission and property owner.\", \"title\": \"Inventory & Condition Documentation\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"tag\": \"Ongoing Support\", \"desc\": \"Dedicated point-of-contact for municipal interface, liaison services, and preventive maintenance coordination.\", \"title\": \"Dedicated Tenancy Concierge\"}]','Leasing Roadmap','From Security Brief to Protocol Handover','A seamless relocation pathway engineered to satisfy stringent institutional timelines.','[{\"desc\": \"Analysing mission housing manuals, security clearance criteria, and rental budget bands.\", \"step\": \"01\", \"title\": \"Housing Directive Review\"}, {\"desc\": \"Presenting standalone villas and floors with embassy-grade security and formal entertaining zones.\", \"step\": \"02\", \"title\": \"Curated Diplomatic Portfolio\"}, {\"desc\": \"Escorted site inspections with embassy regional security officers (RSOs) and attachés.\", \"step\": \"03\", \"title\": \"Security Delegation Tours\"}, {\"desc\": \"Finalizing bilateral lease agreements with diplomatic clauses and registration compliance.\", \"step\": \"04\", \"title\": \"Bilateral Lease Execution\"}, {\"desc\": \"Handover with verified utility certifications, security installations, and inventory logs.\", \"step\": \"05\", \"title\": \"Onboarding & Handover\"}]','“Security is not a luxury. In diplomatic life, it is the foundation.”','Matching ambassadorial standards with gracious Delhi hospitality across Chanakyapuri, Vasant Vihar, and Shanti Niketan.','/assets/images/about/about-living-room.jpg','Why Foreign Missions Choose Elite Homez','Unrivalled institutional experience handling consular tenancies and multinational relocations.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"desc\": \"Intimate familiarity with international diplomatic housing manuals and physical security standards.\", \"icon\": \"shield\", \"title\": \"Embassy-Grade Security Expertise\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"desc\": \"Concentrated inventory across Chanakyapuri, Vasant Vihar, Shanti Niketan, and Golf Links.\", \"icon\": \"location_on\", \"title\": \"Prime Diplomatic Enclave Focus\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"desc\": \"Decades of experience standardizing bilateral diplomatic break clauses and embassy tax exemptions.\", \"icon\": \"history_edu\", \"title\": \"Diplomatic Clause Fluency\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"desc\": \"Curating residences with complete power backup, clean water plants, and modern imported fittings.\", \"icon\": \"check_circle\", \"title\": \"Turnkey Ready Homes\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"desc\": \"High confidentiality protocols protecting diplomat privacy and mission operational security.\", \"icon\": \"lock\", \"title\": \"Strict Protocol Discretion\"}, {\"num\": \"06\", \"desc\": \"Access to prominent South Delhi landlords who respect diplomatic protocol and institutional covenants.\", \"icon\": \"verified_user\", \"title\": \"Direct Landlord Relationships\"}]','/assets/images/areas/chanakyapuri.jpg','Diplomatic Villa · Chanakyapuri','Embassy Residence','Institutional Standards','Frictionless housing for international leadership.','Relocating an ambassador, defense attaché, or regional CEO involves rigorous scrutiny and compressed timelines. Elite Homez delivers institutional speed, pre-vetted residences, and diplomatic lease clarity that eliminates months of administrative friction.','[\"Perimeter Security Audited\", \"Bilateral Diplomatic Clauses\", \"100% Generator Backup\", \"Ongoing Mission Liaison\"]','Consular Desks','Who We Serve','Tailored housing solutions for international institutions and corporate leadership.','[{\"desc\": \"Ambassadorial residences, deputy chanceries, and senior diplomatic staff housing in prime zones.\", \"icon\": \"public\", \"title\": \"Embassies & High Commissions\"}, {\"desc\": \"Managing directors and regional heads of Fortune 500 corporations on multi-year assignments.\", \"icon\": \"business\", \"title\": \"Multinational C-Suite & MDs\"}, {\"desc\": \"World Bank, IMF, UN, and development bank representatives requiring secure, compliant housing.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Supranational Agencies\"}, {\"desc\": \"Discerning property owners seeking reputable, high-credit institutional tenants for long leases.\", \"icon\": \"home\", \"title\": \"Elite Landlords & Estate Owners\"}]','Speak with an Advisor','#confidential-desk','[\"South Delhi Enclaves\", \"Zero Conflict of Interest\", \"RERA Certified\"]','Perspective · Discernment · Heritage','Request A Private Briefing','#confidential-desk','Fiduciary Excellence','Bespoke Guidance & Clarity','Frequently Asked Questions','Clear answers to the most common questions regarding our private advisory services and confidential engagement process.','[{\"answer\": \"Yes. We curate standalone residences, chancery buildings, and ambassadorial villas with secure setbacks, guard annexes, perimeter fortifications, and high-capacity MEP redundancy suited for accredited foreign missions.\", \"question\": \"Do your properties meet diplomatic security protocol standards?\"}, {\"answer\": \"We draft standard diplomatic clause agreements with statutory tax deduction (TDS) exemptions, foreign mission covenants, and bilateral termination terms approved by legal consuls.\", \"question\": \"How are diplomatic lease agreements structured in Delhi?\"}]','Confidential Dialogue','Initiate a Private Advisory Briefing','Share your parameters. A designated Elite Homez Senior Partner will contact you under strict bilateral confidentiality.','[\"Direct Senior Partner Representation\", \"Strict Bilateral Non-Disclosure\", \"Zero Commercial Bias\"]','Submit Confidential Mandate','Elite Homez Advisory','The right property starts with the right advice.','Discover a more considered, confidential way to navigate premier Delhi NCR real estate.','/assets/images/stitch/service-cta-dusk.jpg','Explore Properties Catalogue','/properties','Contact Advisory Desk','/contact-us'),(4,'Real Estate Portfolio Advisory','real-estate-portfolio-advisory','Holistic real estate portfolio management, generational succession structuring, statutory title audits, and capital reallocation for prominent Indian family offices.','## Family Office & Portfolio Structuring\n\nFor ultra-high-net-worth families and multi-generational business dynasties in India, real estate frequently represents a significant proportion of total balance sheet wealth. However, fragmented ownership, legacy partition deeds, unmonetized FAR, and shifting municipal master plans create substantial capital drag. Elite Homez delivers comprehensive portfolio advisory—integrating physical asset audits with family constitutions, tax planning, and strategic reinvestment.','/assets/images/services/turnkey-acquisition.jpg','chart',1,1,4,'Real Estate Portfolio Advisory | Family Office Property Delhi','Strategic real estate portfolio advisory, family office asset structuring, and title due diligence across Delhi NCR by Elite Homez.','2026-09-12 12:09:52','2026-11-16 15:02:59','Practice Mandate 04 · Generational Wealth & Portfolio Structuring','ELITE HOMEZ · PRIVATE WEALTH & FAMILY OFFICE','Multi-Asset Family Office Mandate','Holistic Wealth Integration · 360° Diligence','The Family Office Practice','Strategic governance and value optimization for multi-property holdings.','We transition family real estate holdings from passive, unoptimized assets into resilient, high-yielding portfolios. Working alongside your chartered accountants, wealth managers, and legal trustees, we conduct forensic audits of ownership structures, title regularizations, and development options.','[{\"label\": \"Portfolio Assets Under Advisory\", \"value\": \"₹3,500Cr+\"}, {\"label\": \"Title Regularization Accuracy\", \"value\": \"100%\"}, {\"label\": \"Generational Wealth Preservation\", \"value\": \"3rd Gen\"}]','Strategic Capabilities','Comprehensive Family Office Solutions','Holistic advisory across physical assets, legal structuring, and capital reallocation.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"tag\": \"Comprehensive Audit\", \"desc\": \"Consolidated physical, legal, and financial review of all real estate holdings across residential, commercial, and land parcels.\", \"title\": \"Portfolio Diagnostic & Valuation Audit\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"tag\": \"Risk Mitigation\", \"desc\": \"Resolving ancestral title ambiguities, obtaining probate certificates, clearing municipal dues, and updating revenue records.\", \"title\": \"Title Sanitization & Regularization\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"tag\": \"Value Creation\", \"desc\": \"Advising on collaboration models, turnkey construction partnerships, and FAR enhancements under Master Plan Delhi 2041.\", \"title\": \"Redevelopment & FAR Optimization\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"tag\": \"Estate Planning\", \"desc\": \"Structuring real estate within private family trusts, wills, and succession frameworks to prevent intra-family disputes.\", \"title\": \"Succession & Family Governance\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"tag\": \"Asset Growth\", \"desc\": \"Strategically divesting low-yield legacy assets and reallocating capital into prime trophy estates or pre-leased Grade-A commercial assets.\", \"title\": \"Capital Reallocation & Yield Strategy\"}]','Portfolio Roadmap','From Diagnostic to Optimized Portfolio','A four-phase strategic roadmap delivering generational clarity and capital growth.','[{\"desc\": \"Assembling deeds, lease agreements, municipal sanctions, and tax assessments for all properties.\", \"step\": \"01\", \"title\": \"Consolidated Audit\"}, {\"desc\": \"Benchmarking yields, identifying structural or legal liabilities, and modeling redevelopment upside.\", \"step\": \"02\", \"title\": \"Strategic Diagnostic\"}, {\"desc\": \"Implementing private family trusts, partition settlements, and clean title documentations.\", \"step\": \"03\", \"title\": \"Governance & Structuring\"}, {\"desc\": \"Executing strategic asset divestments, turnkey developments, or prime reinvestment acquisitions.\", \"step\": \"04\", \"title\": \"Active Reallocation\"}]','“Wealth is preserved not by inertia, but by proactive stewardship.”','Ensuring your real estate portfolio remains an enduring pillar of family prosperity across generations.','/assets/images/areas/jor-bagh.jpg','Why Family Offices Partner With Us','A fiduciary partner uniting real estate micro-market mastery with institutional wealth advisory.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"desc\": \"Seamlessly collaborating with your family CIO, tax advisors, private bankers, and legal counsel.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Family Office Ecosystem Integration\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"desc\": \"Unsurpassed capability in untangling complex, multi-decade South Delhi ancestral property titles.\", \"icon\": \"history_edu\", \"title\": \"Deep Legacy Title Expertise\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"desc\": \"Strategic intelligence on Delhi Master Plan revisions, heritage zone constraints, and commercial corridors.\", \"icon\": \"trending_up\", \"title\": \"FAR & Urban Planning Foresight\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"desc\": \"Serving as a neutral, trusted sounding board across generations to preserve harmony and capital.\", \"icon\": \"lock\", \"title\": \"Multi-Generational Discretion\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"desc\": \"Retainer and milestone-based advisory options that eliminate commission-driven transaction bias.\", \"icon\": \"check_circle\", \"title\": \"Conflict-Free Fee Structure\"}, {\"num\": \"06\", \"desc\": \"Trusted by prominent industrial dynasties and family offices managing thousands of crores in prime assets.\", \"icon\": \"verified_user\", \"title\": \"Institutional Execution Track Record\"}]','/assets/images/properties/residence-jor-bagh.jpg','Generational Estate · Jor Bagh','Portfolio Advisory','Holistic Stewardship','Transforming family property from an administrative burden into a strategic advantage.','As families expand across generations, real estate assets often become entangled in conflicting priorities and neglected upkeep. Elite Homez provides the institutional framework, objective valuation clarity, and execution muscle needed to preserve and compound wealth.','[\"Consolidated Portfolio Audits\", \"Private Family Trust Structuring\", \"FAR & Collaboration Advisory\", \"Generational Succession Clarity\"]','Family Office Desks','Who We Advise','Serving family principals, wealth managers, and trustees managing substantial real estate holdings.','[{\"desc\": \"Chief Investment Officers and family principals seeking independent real estate advisory and deal execution.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Single & Multi-Family Offices\"}, {\"desc\": \"Prominent business families requiring equitable property division, title consolidation, and succession planning.\", \"icon\": \"home\", \"title\": \"Multi-Generational Dynasties\"}, {\"desc\": \"Founders seeking to systematically diversify business liquidity into resilient, prime real estate assets.\", \"icon\": \"business\", \"title\": \"Corporate Promoters & Founders\"}, {\"desc\": \"Fiduciary trustees requiring independent asset valuations, statutory compliance audits, and asset monetization.\", \"icon\": \"public\", \"title\": \"Estate Trustees & Executors\"}]','Speak with an Advisor','#confidential-desk','[\"South Delhi Enclaves\", \"Zero Conflict of Interest\", \"RERA Certified\"]','Perspective · Discernment · Heritage','Request A Private Briefing','#confidential-desk','Fiduciary Excellence','Bespoke Guidance & Clarity','Frequently Asked Questions','Clear answers to the most common questions regarding our private advisory services and confidential engagement process.','[{\"answer\": \"We conduct holistic diagnostics across residential and commercial holdings, evaluating lease yield performance, capital appreciation velocity, heritage encumbrances, and generational succession planning.\", \"question\": \"What does portfolio asset optimization entail?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. We partner with India’s leading luxury architects and vetted tier-1 developers to structure joint-venture and turnkey collaboration agreements that maximize FAR and economic value for landholders.\", \"question\": \"Do you advise on redevelopment and builder floor conversions?\"}]','Confidential Dialogue','Initiate a Private Advisory Briefing','Share your parameters. A designated Elite Homez Senior Partner will contact you under strict bilateral confidentiality.','[\"Direct Senior Partner Representation\", \"Strict Bilateral Non-Disclosure\", \"Zero Commercial Bias\"]','Submit Confidential Mandate','Elite Homez Advisory','The right property starts with the right advice.','Discover a more considered, confidential way to navigate premier Delhi NCR real estate.','/assets/images/stitch/service-cta-dusk.jpg','Explore Properties Catalogue','/properties','Contact Advisory Desk','/contact-us'),(7,'BROKING SERVICES','broking-services','Hello Test We are the best executvitve summary','','/uploads/services/9c4de919d7b08558317792cfec34b78a.png','compass',1,1,5,'BROKING SERVICES | Elite Homez Advisory','Hello Test We are the best executvitve summary','2026-11-16 14:40:00','2026-11-16 15:02:59','BEST BROKING SERIVES','ELITE HOMEZ · PRIVATE REAL ESTATE ADVISORY','Exclusive Client Representation2','Zero Conflict · 100% Aligned3','The Elite Homez Approach','Property decisions deserve a more personal, discreet approach.','In the rarefied landscape of Delhi NCR’s trophy real estate, the finest opportunities are rarely advertised on open portals. They trade in quiet confidence between established generational families and vetted private offices.\r\n\r\nElite Homez operates exclusively on the client side of the transaction. We act not as conventional transactional brokers, but as personal property fiduciaries examining legal title, spatial viability, structural integrity, and long-term liquidity.','[{\"label\": \"Client Alignment\", \"value\": \"100%\"}, {\"label\": \"Enclave Mastery\", \"value\": \"25+ Yrs\"}, {\"label\": \"Broker Conflicts\", \"value\": \"0%\"}]','Systematic Due Diligence','What We Deliver','A rigorous, institutional methodology tailored specifically to high-value real estate engagements.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"tag\": \"Discovery\", \"desc\": \"Structured intake sessions to codify architectural criteria, statutory parameters, and private family office governance.\", \"title\": \"Confidential Briefing\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"tag\": \"Off-Market\", \"desc\": \"Direct off-market sweeps across private trusts and vetted landholders with zero portal exposure.\", \"title\": \"Curated Selection\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"tag\": \"Legal Audit\", \"desc\": \"Forensic 30-year title checks, encumbrance audits, structural engineering reviews, and municipal sanction vetting.\", \"title\": \"Due Diligence & Title\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"tag\": \"Transaction\", \"desc\": \"Senior Partner advocacy to enforce fair valuation metrics and absolute commercial confidentiality.\", \"title\": \"Fiduciary Negotiation\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"tag\": \"Closing\", \"desc\": \"End-to-end conveyance deed registration, municipal property tax mutations, and physical key handover concierge.\", \"title\": \"Settlement & Handover\"}]','Client Roadmap','From Mandate to Complete Settlement','A structured journey engineered for absolute peace of mind and decisive execution.','[{\"desc\": \"Defining spatial parameters, enclave boundaries, and capital timelines.\", \"step\": \"01\", \"title\": \"Discovery\"}, {\"desc\": \"Unlocking private off-market inventory and family office holdings.\", \"step\": \"02\", \"title\": \"Curation\"}, {\"desc\": \"Private, escorted walkthroughs arranged around your schedule.\", \"step\": \"03\", \"title\": \"Shortlist\"}, {\"desc\": \"Forensic 30-year title checks, encumbrance verification, and zoning permits.\", \"step\": \"04\", \"title\": \"Diligence\"}, {\"desc\": \"Discreet fiduciary bargaining to secure optimal terms and asset pricing.\", \"step\": \"05\", \"title\": \"Negotiation\"}, {\"desc\": \"Conveyance deed registry, municipal transfer, and post-possession onboarding.\", \"step\": \"06\", \"title\": \"Handover\"}]','“Access matters. Judgement matters more.”','Our role is not simply to show you property. It is to help you make an enduring, generational decision anchored in long-term value.','/assets/images/stitch/service-living-pause.jpg','Why Elite Homez','Experience, absolute discretion, and a deeper understanding of exceptional Delhi real estate.','[{\"num\": \"01\", \"desc\": \"Decades spent cultivating intimate relationships with South Delhi landholders and private trusts.\", \"icon\": \"history_edu\", \"title\": \"20+ Years in Prime Enclaves\"}, {\"num\": \"02\", \"desc\": \"Transactions conducted purely through private networks and legacy mandates.\", \"icon\": \"visibility_off\", \"title\": \"100% Off-Market Access\"}, {\"num\": \"03\", \"desc\": \"Granular familiarity with plot dimensions, road widths, FAR regulations, and zoning covenants.\", \"icon\": \"location_on\", \"title\": \"Micro-Market Mastery\"}, {\"num\": \"04\", \"desc\": \"A Senior Partner directly stewards every negotiation, review, and property tour.\", \"icon\": \"person\", \"title\": \"Partner-Level Fiduciary\"}, {\"num\": \"05\", \"desc\": \"Absolute privacy protocols protected under bilateral NDA covenants.\", \"icon\": \"lock\", \"title\": \"Strict Non-Disclosure\"}, {\"num\": \"06\", \"desc\": \"Complete statutory compliance under DLRERA2023A00892 with forensic title vetting.\", \"icon\": \"verified_user\", \"title\": \"RERA & Title Verification\"}]','/assets/images/stitch/service-master-suite.jpg','Private Residence · Vasant Vihar','Curated Acquisition','Beyond Brokering','More than a property transaction. An enduring generational asset.','Traditional real estate firms are structured to favor transaction velocity and seller mandates. Elite Homez was conceived on the exact opposite principle: uncompromising client advocacy.\r\n\r\nWe identify hidden boundary disputes, evaluate future infrastructure noise, scrutinize heritage zoning restrictions, and coordinate directly with your private tax and family office advisors before drafting purchase agreements.','[\"Independent Valuations\", \"Discreet Viewings\", \"Legal Conveyance Oversight\", \"Post-Purchase Onboarding\"]','Tailored Client Desks','Who We Help','Our advisory practice is crafted specifically for discerning purchasers with distinct governance criteria.','[{\"desc\": \"Families seeking an enduring primary residence, generational builder floor, or standalone bungalow.\", \"icon\": \"home\", \"title\": \"Private Home Buyers\"}, {\"desc\": \"Capital stewards seeking resilient, defensive trophy assets with strong rental yields and capital preservation.\", \"icon\": \"account_balance\", \"title\": \"Family Offices\"}, {\"desc\": \"Non-resident leaders requiring trusted, on-ground proxy representation with complete legal transparency.\", \"icon\": \"public\", \"title\": \"Global Indians & NRIs\"}, {\"desc\": \"Homeowners seeking superior architectural scale, modern acoustic shielding, and multi-vehicle parking.\", \"icon\": \"trending_up\", \"title\": \"Upgrading Residents\"}]','Speak with an Advisor1','#confidential-desk','[\"South Delhi Enclaves\", \"Zero Conflict of Interest\", \"RERA Certified\"]','Perspective · Discernment · Heritage','Request A Private Briefing','#confidential-desk','Fiduciary Excellence','Bespoke Guidance & Clarity','Frequently Asked Questions','Clear answers to the most common questions regarding our private advisory services and confidential engagement process.','[{\"answer\": \"We operate under an exclusive client representation mandate, conducting structured market sweeps, comprehensive due diligence, and negotiation under strict bilateral non-disclosure.\", \"question\": \"How does this private advisory mandate operate?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Yes. All consultations and mandates are strictly protected by bilateral non-disclosure agreements. We never disclose client identities or financial parameters.\", \"question\": \"Are client communications and identities protected?\"}, {\"answer\": \"Our fee structure is completely transparent, success-contingent, and governed by bilateral advisory agreements without hidden markups.\", \"question\": \"What are the commercial terms and fees?\"}]','Confidential Dialogue','Initiate a Private Advisory Briefing','Share your parameters. A designated Elite Homez Senior Partner will contact you under strict bilateral confidentiality.','[\"Protected by bilateral non-disclosure covenants\", \"Verified RERA Advisory Mandate (DLRERA2023A00892)\", \"Direct Senior Partner Access Only\"]','Submit Confidential Mandate','Elite Homez Advisory','The right property starts with the right advice.','Discover a more considered, confidential way to navigate premier Delhi NCR real estate.','/assets/images/stitch/service-cta-dusk.jpg','Explore Properties Catalogue','/properties','Contact Advisory Desk','/contact-us');
