nd the rare residences within them.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(191,'home_areas_ticker_label','Additional Prime South Delhi Enclaves:','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(192,'home_director_eyebrow','DIRECTOR\'S LETTER','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(193,'home_director_title','\"Discretion is not merely a courtesy. In high-value real estate, it is the cornerstone of trust.\"','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(194,'home_director_pullquote','Over the last twenty years, we have seen prime Delhi real estate transition through cycles, zoning shifts, and generational changes. What has never changed is the value of personal integrity.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(195,'home_director_p1','When high-net-worth families, single family offices, and diplomatic missions entrust us with their residential mandates, they are looking for more than square footage. They require forensic legal clarity, absolute privacy, and an unhurried advisor who tells them the honest truth about an asset before a single rupee is committed.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(196,'home_director_p2','At Elite Homez, our motto \"your trust, our responsibility\" is our binding covenant. Every transaction is directly steered by our senior partners with generational commitment.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(197,'home_director_credentials_eyebrow','FOUNDING PRINCIPAL','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(198,'home_director_credentials_name','Managing Director','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(199,'home_director_credentials_title','Elite Homez Property Advisory','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(200,'home_director_signoff','Elite Homez Advisory','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(201,'home_director_badge','✦ Senior Partner Desk','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(202,'home_director_image','/assets/images/stitch/about-director-office.jpg','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(203,'home_cta_eyebrow','DIRECT PRINCIPAL ADVISORY','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(204,'home_cta_title','Your next address deserves the right advice.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(205,'home_cta_desc','Speak with Elite Homez about your next property decision. Our advisory desk offers uncompromised discretion, deep enclave records, and partner-level stewardship.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(206,'home_cta_btn1_text','Speak With an Advisor','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(207,'home_cta_btn1_url','/contact-us','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(208,'home_cta_btn2_text','Direct WhatsApp Concierge','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(209,'home_cta_btn2_url','','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(210,'home_cta_note','All discussions are treated with strict professional confidentiality under bilateral NDAs.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(211,'home_cta_image','/assets/images/stitch/hero-residence.jpg','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(212,'home_seo_title','Elite Homez | Premium Luxury Real Estate Property Advisory','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(213,'home_seo_description','Elite Homez — your trust, our responsibility. Over 20 years of trusted advisory in prime luxury residences, villas, and builder floors in Vasant Vihar, Jor Bagh, Golf Links, and Chanakyapuri.','home','2026-11-16 17:07:35','2026-11-16 17:07:35'),(214,'home_enquiry_enabled','1','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(215,'home_enquiry_eyebrow','Confidential Dialogue','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(216,'home_enquiry_title','Initiate a Private Advisory Briefing','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(217,'home_enquiry_desc','Share your parameters. A designated Elite Homez Senior Partner will contact you under strict bilateral confidentiality.','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(218,'home_enquiry_feature_1','Protected by bilateral non-disclosure covenants','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(219,'home_enquiry_feature_2','Senior partner consultation within 4 business hours','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(220,'home_enquiry_feature_3','Verified freehold credentials & micro-market intelligence','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(221,'home_enquiry_btn_text','Request Confidential Consultation','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30'),(222,'home_enquiry_wa_text','Direct WhatsApp Concierge','home','2026-11-16 17:24:30','2026-11-16 17:24:30');
